A||N||33||FieroJoe||Need pics of your sunroof!||||6||
Z||000000||FieroJoe||06-02-2001||11:05 PM||||I have been thinking about a sunroof swap for some time now.  I've read a lot of old topics about the swap, and it seems pretty straight forward.  I havent searched the yards around here yet for the parts (I highly doubt they'd have them anyways, they never have Fieros), partly because it has been so rainy and I'd just be swimming in mud there...<P>But, for those of you with a factory sunroof and a digital camera, can you take some pics of the sunroof?  As in, outside mounting, inside view, how the deflector looks when stored/in use, glass mounting hardware, glass stored in front, pics like that.  <P>I was thinking this may have already been covered in the old topics, but I didnt find any pics with the wealth of info there.<P>TIA!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||6
